{"name": "Desting Clash", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\"Desting Clash\" is a roguelike deck-building adventure game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the role of the Fatebearer, commanding a diverse array of heroic warriors to fend off waves of monsters, defeating them in turn-based battles using cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Myths and Legends:</strong><br/>Recruit your champions from myths, legends, and historical figures across the world to hold back the encroaching threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heroes from Europe, China, Egypt, and other regions\u2014drawn from history and folklore\u2014are reimagined in unique cartoon-style designs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"612\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/2e953e806f9af9f9907bf0a7101aff07.poster.avif?t=1769738563\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/2e953e806f9af9f9907bf0a7101aff07.webm?t=1769738563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hero Building:</strong><br/>Assemble your hero squad and crush your enemies with the tactics of Chinese generals, the curses of Egyptian pharaohs, and the divine power of European gods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each faction's heroes possess unique traits and mechanics\u2014master them to overcome the relentless waves of foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"606\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/758d48da07053fe8abd30934b9288933.poster.avif?t=1769738563\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/758d48da07053fe8abd30934b9288933.webm?t=1769738563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/758d48da07053fe8abd30934b9288933.mp4?t=1769738563\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Possibilities:</strong><br/>With over 200 cards and a hero equipment system, no two playthroughs will ever be the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"608\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/e49d76c6ff15d6756d20801e4a34af84.poster.avif?t=1769738563\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/e49d76c6ff15d6756d20801e4a34af84.webm?t=1769738563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/e49d76c6ff15d6756d20801e4a34af84.mp4?t=1769738563\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spell cards, equipment cards, and hero upgrades ensure every battle offers fresh and exciting challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"604\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/a4452df80a0a14a26f1d97f799051d8a.poster.avif?t=1769738563\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/a4452df80a0a14a26f1d97f799051d8a.webm?t=1769738563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/extras/a4452df80a0a14a26f1d97f799051d8a.mp4?t=1769738563\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "\"Desting Clash\" is a roguelike card game similar to Monster Train, where you will control heroes from different countries and eras, build your deck and hero team, challenge numerous monster levels, and become the strongest Fatebearer!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693140/486701b429b52bd97f9b0956e12d29b0adf2438d/header.jpg?t=1769738563", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Strategy", "Card Game", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Roguelike", "Card Battler"], "developers": "\u76f8\u5bf9\u827a\u672f Relativity Art", "publishers": "\u76f8\u5bf9\u827a\u672f Relativity Art", "release_date": "Q3 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3693140", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "30 January 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/e0ezxaPd01I", "first_seen": 1769727600.0, "review_rank": 1334}